Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:49:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/72] fix-juice-6: red tests for J-1 to J-5, and the words
 module they read

test/fix-juice-6.test.js (unit) and test/e2e/fix-juice-6.e2e.js (registered in scripts/e2e.js):
the tax rows' names per country, the household tax line, the remembered period, the grades'
meanings and the card grade's place, at 280x653, 375x812, 352x355 and 1280x800, plus every
phone size for the new lines. public/features/juice-drawer.js holds the words (pure); app.js
does not use it yet, so the app checks fail.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
